# Original HEVC birthday film (270 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB limit).
# The site plays the converted web copy in assets/media/films/.
assets/videos/happy 50th birthday.mp4

# The family's original video wishes (phone videos, often HEVC and large).
# The site plays the converted copies in assets/videos/wishes/ (npm run build:wishes).
Family video wishes/

# The family's original films (the story video alone is 1.4 GB, over GitHub's limit).
# The site plays the prepared copies in assets/videos/family/ (npm run build:films).
# Anchored to the root: git on Windows ignores case, and "VIDEOS/" alone would also hide assets/videos/.
/VIDEOS/
